	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Saepe non curantur literae fideliter, colende <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mi <persName ref="p8418">Myconi</persName>; hinc tu et alii viri boni et singulares <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>amici queruntur id sibi non reddi, quod ta<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>bellionibus reddendum tradidi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scribit d. <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p714">Caelium Curionem</persName> habere acta sessionum; at ego papyro <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>involveram totum fasciculum nomenque <persName ref="p1278">Gastii</persName> in<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scripseram.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cum enim plures essent epistolae illum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>procuratorem omnium delegeram te his molestare <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nolui.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cum vero et <persName ref="p714">Caelius</persName> in eo fascicul<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>o literas haberet ac illi ipsi sessiones quoque communicari <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>volui, primum fortassis omnia in eius manus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>pervenerunt; at primum in <persName ref="p1278">Gastii</persName> et tuas, deinde in <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>aliorum pervenire oportuerat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Verum bene res <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>habet: spero te omnia iam accepisse et legere; nam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>expecto, quando commode remittantur per te et <persName ref="p1278">Gastium</persName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Paravi modo libellum, qui Latine et Germanice <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>excuditur, quo purgo ecclesias nostras ab intentato <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>crimine haereseos et scismatis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Saepe eadem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>res ab aliis quoque tractata est; caeterum in com<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>pendium redegi causam alioqui copiosam consulen<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>s illis, qui non libenter legunt libros <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>copiosos.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dubito autem, an in tantis expeditioni<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>bus <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentati</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Dieselbe Verballhornung im Brief <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> vom 12. Februar!</note> patres pergere possint; s<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>i perrexerint, diabolica et plus quam diabolica <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pertinatia perrexerint.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Forte instituit deus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tragoediam aliquam exhibere mundo, nec possunt <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>viri principes et maximi aliter quam in tragoedia <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>repraesentari.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed quid repraesentari dico?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">age tract<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>entur corporaliter, substantialiter et sanguinaliter etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Es gand wunderbar reden und schryben hin und har, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>das mencklich spüren mag, das grosse werck gottes vor<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>handen.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Der herr erbarme sich siner kylchen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Es söllen <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>der könig von <placeName ref="l825">Denmarch</placeName>, andere und vil <placeName ref="l822">tütscher</placeName> fürsten <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ein pundt mitt <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> gemacht haben uff 12 jar; da <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sol es dem keyser gällten in <placeName ref="l822">Tütschland</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Libenter enim <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>bellum a se in alias nationes transferunt, sapienter.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Dargägen <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>sol der keyser ledig gelassen haben oder ledig lassen wöllen <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>den churfürsten und lantgraffen, denen zuͦgäben <placeName ref="l875">Spangier</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>und <placeName ref="l834">Italier</placeName>, <placeName ref="l994">Neapolitaner</placeName> und <placeName ref="l822">Tütsch</placeName>, und sy wider yn<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>setzen, damitt er durch dise gratiosas personas zwytracht <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>mache in disem pundt.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l875">Hispanicissime</placeName> factum, si verum <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>est, quod dicitur; non pro certo haec et comperto refero, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sed accepta ab aliis ita, ut accepi, narro.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Nolo itaque, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ut dicas te haec a me habere.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Der <placeName ref="l2510">Türgg</placeName> ist <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>gwüßlich in onsaglicher rüstung, sol selbs zuͦ <placeName ref="l1517">Adria<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>nopel</placeName> sin.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Er hat von <placeName ref="l522">Venedigern</placeName> paß begärt <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>60000 ringen pferdten und 10000 zuͦ fuͦß.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Vide, ut Nabu<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>chodonozor se paret contra <placeName ref="l2688">Aegyptium</placeName> regem, contra <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Zedechiam et eius coniuratos.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><persName ref="p5772">Mönch Jörg</persName> ist <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zuͦ <placeName>Wintz</placeName> imm schloß 16. ianuarij durch list <persName ref="p20921">Joan <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Baptiste Gastaldi</persName> erstochen<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Hinweis von RH: <persName ref="p5772">Mönch Jörg</persName> ist <persName ref="p5772">Georg Martinuzzi</persName> (biogr. Anm. in <bibl source="b15">HBBW XII</bibl>), womit die Jahreszahl des Briefes gesichert ist (laut Fabian nicht eindeutig lesbar).</note>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Omnia plena malis.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Oremus <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et adhortemur omnes ad paenitentiam.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Diewyl die <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>kräy mitt dem pfawenschwantz<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Pfauenschwanz als Symbol <placeName ref="l850">Österreichs</placeName>? (vgl. <bibl source="b590">SI</bibl> IX 1033f).</note> wannen macht <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>und prachtet in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>, ist weder glück noch <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>heyl.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Dominus liberet nos.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Sat diu te detinui; vive et <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>vale cum tuis omnibus, domine et frater colendissime et ch<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>arissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te frat<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>res; saluta <persName ref="p1278">Gastium</persName> et amicos reliquos.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Ultima februarii 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tu[us].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName>, fideli <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> ecclesiae pastori, domino et fratri suo <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>honorando et dilecto.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
